          Capturing a blurry picture is one of the most common frustrations in digital photography. Whether snapping a portrait on your smartphone, digitizing an important tax document, or capturing a moving subject, blur can compromise an otherwise great shot. Before discovering <strong>how to remove blur from a photo</strong>, it helps to understand the physical and optical causes behind image softening.
        </p>
